{"title": "第十二章", "index": 1468, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre4\" id=\"IJ2V00-f63310eb08dd4d5faea408e62c2fdc23\">\n<div class=\"calibre15\" id=\"chapter\">\n<p class=\"calibre12\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-kai\">五色令人目盲，五音令人耳聋，五味令人口爽。驰骋畋猎，令人心发狂。难得之货，令人行妨。是以圣人为腹不为目，故去彼取此。</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}